The city of Ljubljana came up with a poster competition to encourage walking in the city.

Walking has always been one of my favourite activities to explore a city — it embeds you in a place much more deeply than an isolated metro or a trapped bus. On a recent trip to Ljubljana I was amazed to explore the city on foot. It is a very walkable city, and this project is a small celebration of that.
